{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2021-09-30 14:17:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER CELEBRATES SENECA PLANT GRAND REOPENING, 25TH YEAR OF OPERATION', 'text': 'AUBURN HILLS, MICH., SEPT. 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BORGWARNER CELEBRATED THE GRAND REOPENING OF ITS SENECA, SOUTH CAROLINA, PRODUCTION FACILITY TODAY, FOLLOWING A 16-MONTH REBUILD AFTER THE PLANT WAS RAVAGED BY A TORNADO ON APRIL 13, 2020.'}